== diags.diag/unless-not-else-braceless-fix
BYN1007 3:5 `unless` with a negated condition is a double negative
  label `unless` already negates
  help use `if` with the condition as written
BYN1018 3:17 the body of `unless` must be a block
  label a single statement
  help wrap the statement in `{ }`
  fix 3:16-3:27  { print("s") }
BYN1006 4:5 `unless` cannot have an `else` branch
  label `else` after `unless`
  help use `if` with the opposite condition, so both branches read positively
